    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132310/extras/36a424fb9482cfb6b04ebdef6870e4a1.poster.avif?t=1747944919\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132310/extras/36a424fb9482cfb6b04ebdef6870e4a1.webm?t=1747944919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Fight in the shifting darkness</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight your way through a living, mysterious labyrinth where danger lurks in every corner. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in combat which blends fast-paced <strong>Hack\u2019n\u2019slash</strong> action with the weight and precision of <strong>Souls-like</strong> games. All this served in classic <strong>Roguelike</strong> fashion.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132310/extras/29030dbd9580eb91a266045224f9ee8c.webp?t=1747944919\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132310/extras/60885bf4b01eeeadbedfc5850a0ddb17.poster.avif?t=1747944919\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132310/extras/60885bf4b01eeeadbedfc5850a0ddb17.webm?t=1747944919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Craft your power</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find gear, enchant weapons and make your artifacts more powerful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into deep itemization systems - <strong>Caveshifter</strong> is designed around build variety, character customization and meaningful progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132310/extras/29030dbd9580eb91a266045224f9ee8c.webp?t=1747944919\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132310/extras/e53ee690efabd1e5d3945e6ae076addd.poster.avif?t=1747944919\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132310/extras/e53ee690efabd1e5d3945e6ae076addd.webm?t=1747944919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore the unknown</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run is different - new rooms, new choices, new rewards. Explore large ever-changing network of caves and uncover all its secrets. This game is heavily focused on <strong>replayability</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132310/extras/36a424fb9482cfb6b04ebdef6870e4a1.poster.avif?t=1747944919\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132310/extras/36a424fb9482cfb6b04ebdef6870e4a1.webm?t=1747944919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Fight in the shifting darkness</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight your way through a living, mysterious labyrinth where danger lurks in every corner. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in combat which blends fast-paced <strong>Hack\u2019n\u2019slash</strong> action with the weight and precision of <strong>Souls-like</strong> games. All this served in classic <strong>Roguelike</strong> fashion.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132310/extras/29030dbd9580eb91a266045224f9ee8c.webp?t=1747944919\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132310/extras/60885bf4b01eeeadbedfc5850a0ddb17.poster.avif?t=1747944919\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132310/extras/60885bf4b01eeeadbedfc5850a0ddb17.webm?t=1747944919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Craft your power</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find gear, enchant weapons and make your artifacts more powerful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into deep itemization systems - <strong>Caveshifter</strong> is designed around build variety, character customization and meaningful progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132310/extras/29030dbd9580eb91a266045224f9ee8c.webp?t=1747944919\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132310/extras/e53ee690efabd1e5d3945e6ae076addd.poster.avif?t=1747944919\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132310/extras/e53ee690efabd1e5d3945e6ae076addd.webm?t=1747944919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore the unknown</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run is different - new rooms, new choices, new rewards. Explore large ever-changing network of caves and uncover all its secrets. This game is heavily focused on <strong>replayability</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
